=== Parity with web source (data / composition / states / i18n / a11y / telemetry) ===
  data sources: useValidateAiProvider (POST /settings/ai/validate-config) + the parent-owned AIProviderDraft +
                isCloud + onChange -> all bound via the AiProviderSource P1/S8 seam (commitDraft = web onChange;
                validate(_:) async = web validate.mutateAsync). No HTTP in the view. useTranslation -> P1/S10 facade.
  composition : Subhead 'Provider configuration'; provider <Select> + Model <Input> grid (label/hint swap for
                Azure non-Foundry); Azure block (Azure surface <Select> + API version + Chat/Embedding deployment
                inputs, deployments hidden for Foundry); local Base URL + Validate; Azure 'Resource endpoint URL';
                cloud API key (secure) + 'Daily cost cap (USD)' (cents<->dollars) + 'Validate connection'; local
                explainer Caption; validate-optional HelperText. Provider brand titles rendered verbatim (proper
                nouns, as in the web); Azure-flavor descriptive labels promoted to facade keys.
  validate    : banner ok+pinned_ip -> 'OK - pinned to {ip}', ok+probed_model -> 'OK - {model} reachable', ok ->
                'OK - provider reachable', fail -> backend message; cleared on any field edit; local button
                disabled when validating || base_url blank, cloud disabled only while validating (empty api_key
                allowed; omitted from payload so the backend keeps its saved key).
  states      : loading / empty / error (+retry) / data + connection axis (live/stale/offline chip + banner,
                one-shot stale auto-refresh) + local/cloud + Azure OpenAI/Foundry flavor + validate ok/fail.
                Every state has a #Preview (11 previews).
  i18n        : 41 keys in AIProviderSection.strings (table 'AIProviderSection'); every web 'ai.settings.provider.*'
                + 'ai.settings.validate.*' key preserved verbatim; {{ip}}/{{model}} -> positional %@; no English
                literals in Swift (facade NSLocalizedString(key, value: fallback)); coverage check = 41/41, 0 missing.
  a11y        : VoiceOver labels on every control (selects, text/secure fields, validate button, refresh), the
                section aria-label 'Provider configuration', the freshness chip, the validate banner (role=status
                -> accessibilityValue 'status: message'), header .isHeader; Dynamic Type via tokens; Reduce Motion
